This directory is a vendored copy of XGBoostLSS (Maerz, A., "XGBoostLSS - An
extension of XGBoost to probabilistic forecasting"),
https://github.com/StatMixedML/XGBoostLSS, distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

It is the copy that produced the published results and is kept here so that the
results do not depend on later upstream changes.  Local modification by the
authors: model.XGBoostLSS.hyper_opt tunes on a held-out validation DMatrix
(instead of cross-validation), with seeded TPE sampling (`seed`, `hp_seed`) and a
time budget (`max_minutes`).  The example datasets of the upstream package are
omitted.
